  trait:
    kind: 4
    title: Iaijutsu
    text: "Hold the attack and Ren stands in the draw while a meter fills beside him. Past the mark (0.5s) the cut leaves the sheath 60% deeper and stuns lesser foes for 0.8s; hold on and it keeps deepening, up to +100% at a full meter (1.5s). Release before the mark and it is an ordinary cut."
    window: 0.5
